+/*
+ * File Explorer: the folder window (Stained Glass OS)
+ *
+ * The frame around shell32's ExplorerBrowser, laid out as Windows 10/11's
+ * File Explorer is: a command bar; back, forward, up, a breadcrumb address
+ * bar that becomes editable, refresh and a search box; a navigation pane
+ * (Quick access, This PC with its folders and drives, Network); the folder
+ * itself; a status bar with the item and selection counts and the view
+ * switch. This PC is its own page, folders and drives with capacity bars,
+ * and a search shows its results in place of the folder.
+ *
+ * Everything here is our own work, drawn with GDI and GDI+; no Microsoft
+ * code, symbols or artwork.
